{"duration": 30.13, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.46, "text": "In 2023, a team that included Alison Kock\nand Alison Towner studied great white"}, {"start": 6.46, "end": 11.18, "text": "records from the whole South African coast.\nThey found that numbers looked steady"}, {"start": 11.18, "end": 17.7, "text": "overall. Sightings had fallen in the\nwest and risen in the east. At Algoa Bay,"}, {"start": 17.7, "end": 23.26, "text": "shore anglers caught six great\nwhites in 2013 and 59 in 2019."}, {"start": 23.96, "end": 30.13, "text": "To that team, it looked as if many sharks\nhad moved east, away from the orcas."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.16, "text": "In"}, {"start": 0.16, "end": 1.64, "text": "2023,"}, {"start": 2.06, "end": 2.12, "text": "a"}, {"start": 2.12, "end": 2.4, "text": "team"}, {"start": 2.4, "end": 2.6, "text": "that"}, {"start": 2.6, "end": 3.04, "text": "included"}, {"start": 3.04, "end": 3.54, "text": "Alison"}, {"start": 3.54, "end": 3.88, "text": "Kock"}, {"start": 3.88, "end": 4.1, "text": "and"}, {"start": 4.1, "end": 4.48, "text": "Alison"}, {"start": 4.48, "end": 5.14, "text": "Towner"}, {"start": 5.14, "end": 5.7, "text": "studied"}, {"start": 5.7, "end": 6.16, "text": "great"}, {"start": 6.16, "end": 6.46, "text": "white"}, {"start": 6.46, "end": 6.94, "text": "records"}, {"start": 6.94, "end": 7.2, "text": "from"}, {"start": 7.2, "end": 7.36, "text": "the"}, {"start": 7.36, "end": 7.58, "text": "whole"}, {"start": 7.58, "end": 7.86, "text": "South"}, {"start": 7.86, "end": 8.4, "text": "African"}, {"start": 8.4, "end": 8.76, "text": "coast."}, {"start": 9.48, "end": 9.58, "text": "They"}, {"start": 9.58, "end": 9.86, "text": "found"}, {"start": 9.86, "end": 10.08, "text": "that"}, {"start": 10.08, "end": 10.52, "text": "numbers"}, {"start": 10.52, "end": 10.74, "text": "looked"}, {"start": 10.74, "end": 11.18, "text": "steady"}, {"start": 11.18, "end": 11.76, "text": "overall."}, {"start": 12.64, "end": 12.9, "text": "Sightings"